            "release_notes_markdown": "Gameplay update, for [MirrorKit 1.0.0](https://github.com/SageFlare/MirrorKit/releases/tag/v1.0.0) or later (required). Same maze and mirrors as 1.0.0. The map now plays like the official free-for-all maps.\n\n- **Kill cap and end screen:** first to 40 kills wins (the cap grows with the player count, bots included, like on official FFA maps), with the objective bar, \"kills to win\" banners and announcer lines, and the end screen. 15-minute match timer.\n- **Spawns:** 128 spawn points over the whole maze (was 16), respawn waves every 6 seconds. Large bot counts no longer leave players stuck dead.\n- **Bots roam:** bots now explore the maze instead of staying in the room they spawned in.\n- **Cinematics:** an intro with a map-name voice line, then camera flights through the maze while players wait for the match.\n- **Normal match start:** the map no longer skips the start wait. Servers keep their own warmup settings.\n- **Map info:** the map now shows its name and description in the game's map details.\n\n**If every map started instantly after playing 1.0.0:** 1.0.0 skipped the start wait, and this may have been saved in your game settings. Open `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Chivalry 2\\Saved_Unchained\\Config\\WindowsNoEditor\\Game.ini` and delete any `MinTimeBeforeStartingMatch=0` and `MaxTimeBeforeStartingMatch=0` lines.\n\nInstall `MirrorMaze.pak` together with `MirrorKit.pak`. Page: https://sageflare.github.io/MirrorMaze/\n",
